From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:43:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Move shots_hittest() into its own assembly module

It precedes the C++ pillar code and follows the stage 3 code, which can now
be decompiled in place. Its conditional branches show that ZUN compiled it
with -2.
---
 Tupfile.lua           |   1 +
 th02/main/hittest.asm | 243 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 th02_main.asm         | 213 +-----------------------------------
 3 files changed, 245 insertions(+), 212 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 th02/main/hittest.asm

